line	<str>Go to the chicken farm near the water wheel (File:Dairy churn icon.png icon on the east side of the river) and go through the southern gate.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>With both hands free, search one of the southern empty crates and <col=800000>Zanik</col> will hide in it.</col>
step	31	-	Quick guide step 31
line	<str>Follow Kazgar, who is through the hole in the wall under Lumbridge kitchen</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Mistag at the Dorgeshuun mines to start the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Bring two sets of H.A.M. robes to Zanik in Lumbridge cellar. (Can be purchased from the G.E.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Zanik will follow you, if you lose her go back to the cellar. Talk to the townspeople with her following.</str>
line	
line	<str># Talk to the Cook</str>
line	
line	<str># Talk to the Duke</str>
line	
line	<str># Talk to Hans</str>
line	
line	<str># Talk to any Man or Woman (Zanik must engage in the conversation. Try another if she does not.)</str>
line	
line	<str># Talk to Bob</str>
line	
line	<str># Talk to Father Aereck</str>
line	
line	<str># Talk to Lumbridge Guide</str>
line	
line	<str># Walk near a goblin. Zanik will talk to one.</str>
line	
line	<str># Talk to the shopkeeper</str>
line	
line	<str>Ask Zanik, "Have you seen enough of Lumbridge yet?"</str>
line	
line	<str>Put on your set of H.A.M. robes, and go to the H.A.M. Hideout (west of the general store) and pick the lock to the entrance trapdoor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Johanhus Ulsbrecht south-east of the stage.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wander around the south of the stage, Zanik will spot a trapdoor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick the trapdoor and go down. You'll need Zanik to kill the guards in this room to continue:</str>
line	
line	<str>#Walk west past the first guard and talk to him, then Zanik will shoot him.</str>
line	
line	<str>#Squeeze through the crack in the wall. Wait for the guard in the central corridor to walk by, then squeeze through the next crack in the wall. Run west behind the guard by the door and talk to him, then Zanik will shoot him.</str>
line	
line	<str>#When the guard in the corridor starts walking east, talk to Zanik and say "Now!", and Zanik will snipe him.</str>
line	
line	<str>#Move to the east side of the central corridor but stop with Zanik as far east as possible without joining the eastern corridor (this can be easily done by moving into that square and then walking one square west but be careful not to walk into the Eastern corridor). Talk to Zanik again and tell her to wait. Then, run west, south then east to the end of the corridor So the north eastern guard sees you and walks towards you. Zanik will shoot him as he passes the central corridor.</str>
line	
line	<str>#For the final guard, again position Zanik as far north on as you can without the guard seeing you. Tell her to wait here and then head to the opposite position (top of the east/west corridors). Walk northward, causing the guard to walk towards you and Zanik will shoot him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Listen at the door. A senior guard will appear and arrest you.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick the lock to escape the cell, then climb up the ladder and leave the hideout to find Zanik, dead. Take her body.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Juna in the Chasm of Tears.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Juna and collect 20 Tears of Guthix to start the cutscene. Remember to have both hands free.</str>
line	
line	<str>With your full H.A.M. robes and gear for the fight, return to the castle cellar and talk to Zanik.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the chicken farm near the water wheel (File:Dairy churn icon.png icon on the east side of the river) and go through the southern gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>With both hands free, search one of the southern empty crates and Zanik will hide in it.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>While wearing the full H.A.M. robes, climb down the nearby trapdoor, and head to the western room. You will see <col=800000>Sigmund (level 50)</col> and three <col=800000>Senior Guards (level 22)</col>.</col>
