line	
line	<col=000080>Kill the guards first, then Sigmund. He will use <col=800000>protection prayers</col>, but will use only <col=800000>protect from missiles</col> in the second phase. You can safespot the guards using <col=800000>Zanik</col>, and you can safespot Sigmund using the boxes. Make sure Zanik hits Sigmund before you do. This way, you will be able to damage him.</col>
